PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 04:59:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/how-much-the-immune-system-sees-may-shape-how-well-we-fight-infections</guid></item><item><title>重新思考 CAR T：模块化制造与 allinone 系统</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/rethinking-car-t-modular-manufacturing-versus-allinone-systems</link><description>随着 CAR T 疗法需求的增长，模块化平台为工艺开发团队提供了改善细胞扩增、恢复和放大的新方法。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/rethinking-car-t-modular-manufacturing-versus-allinone-systems.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 04:44:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/rethinking-car-t-modular-manufacturing-versus-allinone-systems</guid></item><item><title>通过基于 NanoERASER 的成人神经再生逆转阿尔茨海默病的进展</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/reverse-the-progression-of-alzheimers-disease-through-nanoeraserbased-adult-neuroregeneration</link><description>阿尔茨海默病中的神经退行性疾病超过了大脑再生神经元的能力。王等人。开发一个 Nano-ERASER 平台，将抗 PTBP1 抗体传递到星形胶质细胞中，实现蛋白酶体介导的 PTBP1 降解并激活神经元重编程。这种基于纳米技术的 Trim-Away 系统可诱导功能性神经发生&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/reverse-the-progression-of-alzheimers-disease-through-nanoeraserbased-adult-neuroregeneration.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 04:29:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/reverse-the-progression-of-alzheimers-disease-through-nanoeraserbased-adult-neuroregeneration</guid></item><item><title>纳米颗粒通过从其他细胞中制造神经元来缓解阿尔茨海默病</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nanoparticles-ease-alzheimers-by-making-neurons-from-other-cells</link><description>一种由纳米粒子和抗体组成的笼子组成的药物，可以从另一种类型的脑细胞中产生神经元，从而缓解小鼠的阿尔茨海默病症状&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nanoparticles-ease-alzheimers-by-making-neurons-from-other-cells.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 04:14:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nanoparticles-ease-alzheimers-by-making-neurons-from-other-cells</guid></item><item><title>哥伦比亚工程师制造了一种无颜料的聚合物涂层，里面充满了微小的气孔；在亚利桑那州沙漠的阳光下，涂层表面的温度比环境空气温度低约 6°C</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/columbia-engineers-built-a-pigmentfree-polymer-coating-filled-with-microscopic-air-pores-under-arizona-desert-sun-the-coated-surface-stayed-about-6c-below-ambient-air</link><description>随着炎热天气期间气温升高，保持建筑物和其他结构凉爽可能需要大量能源。空调是处理热量的常见方式，但它们消耗电力并且需要使用冷却系统，在某些情况下，需要使用可能影响环境的冷却剂。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/columbia-engineers-built-a-pigmentfree-polymer-coating-filled-with-microscopic-air-pores-under-arizona-desert-sun-the-coated-surface-stayed-about-6c-below-ambient-air.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 03:59:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/columbia-engineers-built-a-pigmentfree-polymer-coating-filled-with-microscopic-air-pores-under-arizona-desert-sun-the-coated-surface-stayed-about-6c-below-ambient-air</guid></item><item><title>世界首个测试通过光束无丢失地发送信息</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/worldfirst-test-sends-information-through-light-beams-without-loss</link><description>世界首次试验表明，用拓扑信息编码的光可以承受严重的大气扭曲。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/worldfirst-test-sends-information-through-light-beams-without-loss.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 03:44:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/worldfirst-test-sends-information-through-light-beams-without-loss</guid></item><item><title>ABB 和 NVIDIA 声称 SimtoReal 准确度达到 99%：这个数字遗漏了什么</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/abb-and-nvidias-99-simtoreal-accuracy-claim-what-the-number-leaves-out</link><description>ABB 和 NVIDIA 正在将 Omniverse 模拟库以 HyperReality 的名义嵌入到 RobotStudio 中，声称模拟与真实的准确度高达 99%，设置速度加快 80%，成本降低 40%，上市时间加快 50%。富士康正在试用该系统用于消费电子产品组装。该数字是真实且可独立归因的，但它描述了一家公司的受控飞行员，并不能保证转移到更混乱的工业环境。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/abb-and-nvidias-99-simtoreal-accuracy-claim-what-the-number-leaves-out.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 03:29:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/abb-and-nvidias-99-simtoreal-accuracy-claim-what-the-number-leaves-out</guid></item><item><title>深部脑刺激显示出改善脑外伤后沟通的潜力</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/deep-brain-stimulation-shows-potential-to-improve-communication-after-traumatic-brain-injury</link><description>匹兹堡大学医学院发表于 2017 年的一项新研究表明，深部脑刺激（DBS）可能有助于改善由创伤性脑损伤（TBI）引起的言语和吞咽问题。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/deep-brain-stimulation-shows-potential-to-improve-communication-after-traumatic-brain-injury.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 03:14:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/deep-brain-stimulation-shows-potential-to-improve-communication-after-traumatic-brain-injury</guid></item></channel></rss>